# pubspec 模板；@VERSION@ 由 package.sh 替换。
name: pagesift
description: Dart binding of libpagesift (dart:ffi). Converts HTML, PDF, Office and other documents to Markdown and JSON. Bundles the native library for linux-x64, linux-arm64 and macos-arm64.
version: @VERSION@
homepage: https://github.com/YOLOW92/pagesift
repository: https://github.com/YOLOW92/pagesift/tree/main/bindings/dart
issue_tracker: https://github.com/YOLOW92/pagesift/issues
topics:
  - markdown
  - pdf
  - scraping
  - ffi
environment:
  sdk: ^3.3.0
